# OWASP ZAP baseline scan output (Phase 8 Task B3, scripts/security-scan.sh)
# — the triaged findings live in docs/runbook-security-scan.md; the raw
# report is a local artifact, same treatment as playwright-report/ above.
/zap-out/
public/media/e2e-tl-*.mp4
public/media/assembled_*.mp4
public/media/_seg_*.mp4
public/media/_tmp_*
public/media/_concat_*.txt
.claude/

# runtime output — model generations and user uploads. Regenerable or
# user-supplied, and binary, so keeping them out of history stops every
# re-render from bloating the repo. Supersedes the per-pattern
# public/media rules above; those stay for clarity about what lands here.
/public/media/
/public/uploads/
